Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","user":"Craig Oxbrow","date":". 11-07-2013, 09:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T17:59:07-08:00","id":6505,"title":"","content":"WOOT!!! Adventure is an awesome setting .. Pulp action at its coolest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T00:20:49-08:00","id":6675,"title":"","content":"Strangely, Adventure! is the only game of the three that I have never played. It sounds good though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/869-bc001","name":"BC001","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar869_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T11:59:03-08:00","id":6956,"title":"","content":"TO BC001, <b>Adventure!</b> is a grand game. It's set up to encourage the swashbuckling style of the old pulps. The rules support PCs acting like fictional characters, and they do it well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T10:18:10-08:00","id":17166,"title":"","content":"Wasn't Bruce Baugh heavily involved in Adventure!'s design? I haven't heard anything about him in a while, is he on board with the new versions of the Aeonverse?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T12:44:16-08:00","id":17238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/4956-will-there-be-a-book-to-cover-adventure?p=17166#post17166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't Bruce Baugh heavily involved in Adventure!'s design? I haven't heard anything about him in a while, is he on board with the new versions of the Trinity Continuum?</div> </div> </div> </div>Bruce has persistent immune system issues which affect his health. He hasn't really been involved in RPGs in general since Gamma World for d20 Modern. He has, however, given me his blessing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T21:25:21-08:00","id":17500,"title":"","content":"Oh man, that's too bad. Seems like a number of great game designers are coming down with health problems lately...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> My best to him when you talk with him again!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T08:12:06-08:00","id":17720,"title":"","content":"I love this entire line. Adventure! books were going for $80+ for a while on Ebay. I hope my GM restarts our game with the new system. We last left our intrepid heroes on top of a Nazi zeppelin somewhere over Princeton, NJ after my character had crashed landed his Ford Tri-motor on top of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T15:47:29-08:00","id":20830,"title":"","content":"I suppose one of the REALLY interesting questions we'll get to ask this time around is what Daredevils evolve into after G-day. Are we end up with multiple paramorphs this time around? Heh...this time around...I kill me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/564-deathevn","name":"Deathevn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T18:19:15-08:00","id":20903,"title":"","content":"First of all, we\u2019ll need to find out whether daredevils <i>are</i> paramorphs in the Trinity Continuum. <i>If</i> they are, and if they \u201cevolve\u201d, I would hope that their evolved state would be more akin to the Solars of <b>Exalted</b> (but with less bookkeeping) than to the Superiors of <b>Asia Ascendant</b>. But really, I\u2019m hoping that Talents aren\u2019t paramorphs at all \u2014 just extraordinarily capable baselines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T20:01:57-08:00","id":20951,"title":"","content":"They're almost certainly not, actually. If for no other reason than that I think the Knack Mercer's described as having is also listed as a Dynamic, not a Heroic. I Just had to bait the hook to see if people actually caught a reference. So happy. As to superiors, I don't really recall them clearly, but IIRC, they didn't seem quite right for it. Didn't they come off as Nova lite? It's honestly been SO long since I got my one quick look at that book that I don't recall. I'd love a refresh on them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/564-deathevn","name":"Deathevn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T20:11:18-08:00","id":20955,"title":"","content":"FWIW, Mercer\u2019s Knack in <b>Adventure!</b> is listed as a \u201cUnique\u201d Knack: it is explicitly <i>not</i> Psychic, Dynamic, or Heroic, in keeping with its editor\u2019s stance that Mercer was the only paramorph. <br /> <br /> That said, that was the Trinity Universe; this is the Trinity Continuum. Similar, but not the same.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T06:36:49-08:00","id":21143,"title":"","content":"There is only one <i>known</i> paramorph, implied to be Mercer. His Chronal Awareness knack is indeed outside of the framework of the psychic, dynamic, and heroic categories.<br /> <br /> Superiors are the result of the Nakamura Process. A proto-nova is identified and run through the Process, which prevents them from erupting. The resultant Superiors have extra dots of Attributes and Abilities (which can go as high as 6), and heal faster than normal. STs with <b>Adventure!</b> are given the option of allowing creation of super-science gadgets or access to a few heroic knacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}